{% extends 'site/guideBase.html.twig' %}
{% block content %}
    <div class="uw-card">
        <div class="uw-card-body">
                The market allows you to trade resources with other players.<br />
                <b>Note:</b> The market is only available if it is enabled on the world you are playing in.<br />
                The "Your orders" section allows you to view and cancel your active market orders.
                <br />
                <br />
                <ul>

                    <li>
                        <b>Buy:</b> Instantly buy resources from another player.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <b>Sell:</b> Instantly sell resources to another player.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <b>Buy order:</b> You are looking for resources, but they are not on the market? Place a new buy order.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <b>Sell order:</b> You have too many resources? Place a sell order and you will sell it soon.
                    </li>
                </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
